      "writtenOn": "2024-05-02T21:08:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should anything happen to the unattached policy if this function is called in an attached source state? What about attached sink? Is there any risk of a race where the state changes while this function is running or after the flags are set but before they are checked?",
      "revId": "7a193859ea5dae50a342bc95ab7db16b1eca5b29",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
